OL,3,ASam Fender pre-sale moved after 'bot
OL,4,Aattack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam Fender has rescheduled the pre-sale
OL,7,Ffor his tour's homecoming show after a
OL,8,F"sophisticated bot attack" reportedly
OL,9,Faffected a ticketing website.
OL,11,FIn a post on Instagram, the 32-year-old
OL,12,Fsaid he had been told the site Gigantic
OL,13,Fhad been hit for his shows at St James'
OL,14,FPark in Newcastle in summer 2027,
OL,15,Fprompting him to move the sale back 24
OL,16,Fhours to 09:30 GMT on Thursday.
OL,18,FIt came days after he removed a ticket
OL,19,Fcategory from sale due to his
OL,20,Funhappiness with the costs for fans,
OL,21,Fwhich he said were out of his control.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
